 "insight": [
  "The mass of Luxembourg's fuel imports increased slightly from 2.75 billion kg in 2005 to 2.81 billion kg in 2025.",
  "The imports peaked at 4.85 billion kg in 2011, which is the highest value in the period.",
  "The largest change between consecutive years was from 2.55 billion kg in 2009 to 4.27 billion kg in 2010.",
  "The two largest import years, 2011 and 2022, together account for 13.6% of the total imports over 2005 to 2025.",
  "The data only includes quantities for trade where the volume is known, so some trade volumes are missing."
 ],
